	(text "Planned (dashed): REV high = COM to NO on both switches: coil A\nreversed, so the same blank raster rows feed backwards. R1 keeps\nit forward while the Pi boots. Switch only with the motor still.\nMAX4624: 1 ohm, 200 mA cont. / 400 mA peak, COM/NC/NO within\n0..V+ (5 V). To check first: the driver's motor supply <= 5 V and\nthe coil current; if not, the switches go on the driver's inputs.\nToday coil A is wired straight: OUT_A1 = COIL_A1, OUT_A2 = COIL_A2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
